job_title: Senior Python Backend Developer
company_repo: fastapi/fastapi
salary_range: $140k-$180k
overview: "Join the FastAPI core team to help develop and maintain one of the most popular modern Python web frameworks, used by companies like Microsoft, Netflix, and Uber. You'll work on high-performance async web applications, API development, and core framework features."
overview_reason: Based on README.md analysis showing FastAPI's widespread adoption by major companies and its focus on performance and modern Python features.
