responsibilities[6,]{responsibility,reason}:
  Develop and maintain core FastAPI framework features and components,Core focus of the role working on framework development
  Design and implement high-performance async APIs and middleware systems,FastAPI's core functionality relies on async performance
  Create and review technical documentation for framework features,Essential for framework usability and adoption
  Contribute to architectural decisions and framework design,Senior role requires architectural input
  Review and merge community pull requests while maintaining code quality,Open source project maintenance requirement
  Help maintain framework compatibility with latest Python versions and dependencies,Ensures framework stays current and compatible
qualifications[8,]{qualification,importance,reason}:
  5+ years of Python backend development experience,must-have,Complex framework development requires extensive Python expertise
  Strong understanding of async programming in Python,must-have,FastAPI is built on async principles
  Deep knowledge of REST APIs and modern web protocols,must-have,Core to FastAPI's functionality
  Experience with type hints and modern Python features,must-have,FastAPI heavily utilizes Python type hints
  Proven track record of open source contributions,must-have,Role involves open source project maintenance
  Excellent understanding of API design and documentation,must-have,Essential for framework development and documentation
  Strong debugging and problem-solving skills,must-have,Required for maintaining complex framework
  Experience with testing frameworks and CI/CD pipelines,must-have,Necessary for quality assurance and deployment
